                        <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Bridging the gap between mechanics &#xa;and car owners through &#xa;transparency and automation.&#xa;&#xa;Traditional repair shops often &#xa;struggle with manual &#xa;record-keeping and customer &#xa;miscommunication. &#xa;FIXO digitizes these workflows &#xa;to bring honesty back to the garage.&#xa;&#xa;A specialized platform designed to&#xa;streamline shop workflows,&#xa;ensuring every repair is documented, &#xa;tracked, and verified.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;"/>
